.TH ARENA 1 "July 2026" "UCI Arena Manager" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
arena \- control UCI Arena Manager from the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B arena
[\fB\-\-endpoint\fR \fIURL\fR]
[\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-output\fR \fIhuman|json|jsonl\fR]
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B arena
uses the authenticated loopback control contract shared by the desktop
application and dashboard. Global flags must appear before the command.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-endpoint " URL"
Manager service endpoint. The default is http://127.0.0.1:47831.
.TP
.BI \-\-data\-dir " PATH"
Manager data directory containing client.key. The default is
/var/lib/uci-arena on Linux.
.TP
.BI \-\-output " FORMAT"
Output format: human, json, or jsonl.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show context-sensitive help. Use
.B arena COMMAND \-\-help
for command options.
.SH COMMON COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show control-plane status.
.TP
.B health
Show control-plane health.
.TP
.B doctor
Run safe local diagnostics.
.TP
.B ui
Open the paired dashboard in an external browser for monitoring and
troubleshooting. Normal desktop startup uses the UCI Arena Manager application
launcher and does not require a terminal.
.TP
.B engine list
List registered UCI engines.
.TP
.BI "engine probe " EXECUTABLE
Probe a UCI executable without registering it. Use
.BI "--model-root " PATH
to apply an advertised ModelRoot option before readiness validation.
.TP
.B engine add
Probe and register a UCI engine. The optional
.BI "--model-root " PATH
uses the same advertised option contract.
.TP
.BI "engine set-model " ENGINE-ID " --model-root " PATH
Select ModelRoot for a registered UCI Arena Engine through a
revision-checked full refresh.
.TP
.B service profiles
List external service adapter profiles.
.TP
.B daemon status
Query the native Manager service state.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
arena status
arena --output json health
arena ui
arena engine probe /opt/engines/my-engine
arena engine set-model ENGINE-ID --model-root /opt/uci-arena/models/selected
arena engine list
arena service profiles
arena --endpoint http://127.0.0.1:47831 doctor
.fi
.SH SETUP
Suite component installation is performed by
.B arena-setup
from the independently installed UCI Arena Suite Setup package. The Manager
desktop host invokes only that adjacent typed Installer boundary.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/uci-arena/client.key
Local CLI authentication key. Do not copy or expose it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1)
